 "reviewNotes": "V1.15 Orange plate: the layout F rear converter box regenerated by back-plate/layout-F/build_f.py with the hidden M2 x 10 cap screw and hook instead of the two ears, a solid front plate (passage P1 deleted) and the wire notches A and B for the 7 V and 5 V pairs; same rim-down and tongues-up poses as V1.11 (frame bed contact 252.0 mm2 against the row minimum 250). Reviewed by scripts/review_v115.py (first layer >= 0.8 x flat contact, support reaches the front-plate ceiling and the cover flap, no brim extrusion) and review_brim.py (per-object plan). White plate unchanged from V1.14 (scripts/review_v112.py: cap brim only, support interface 3 layers at 0.15, support ironing on, no support at the pilots). Orange Bambu: passed, 6419 s, 28.32 g; Orange Elegoo: passed, 6284 s, 27.24 g; White Bambu: passed, 14583 s, 87.82 g; White Elegoo: passed, 15206 s, 87.03 g"
